                                                "sense_id": "30bc23a0-d794-3d46-a77d-b13dc6b78992",
                                                "text": "1906, Association of Professors and Researchers in Religious Education, Religious Education\nThe traditional community image of the pk (preacher's kid) and the social control function of gossip in relation to the minister's wife underline the interlocking nature […]"
                                            },
