                                                "sense_id": "30bc23a0-d794-3d46-a77d-b13dc6b78992",
                                                "text": "I was a typical PK (preacher's kid), full of mischief, full of life and insatiable curiosity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce388f93-b114-46fa-8281-e53a3841763e",
                                                "sense_id": "30bc23a0-d794-3d46-a77d-b13dc6b78992",
                                                "text": "And after all, I was a PK (preacher's kid) and no one wanted to play with a PK in any case! It might be catching, like the measles!"
